*.log
risk_checks_backup.jsonl
.git/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Frontend build outputs are rebuilt from source in the frontend stage of
# the Dockerfile and overlaid onto the runtime image after `COPY . .`.
# Excluding them here shrinks the build context and, more importantly,
# stops any stale/untracked local build artifacts (e.g. leftover hashed
# chunks from a prior `npm run build`) from leaking into the runtime image
# via `COPY . .` regardless of what git tracks. Other static/ files (SEO
# HTML wrappers, sitemap/robots, logo/og images) are untouched by these
# two patterns and continue to come from the build context as before.
static/index.html
static/assets/
e2e-artifacts/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Local garage review runtimes and data are never image inputs.
garage/.venv*/
garage/.playwright*/
garage/web/node_modules/
garage/web/dist/
garage/web/dist-mock/
garage/review/

# Test-only content of the garage app is never an image input: the pytest suite, its conftest and contract
# checker, and every fixture or sample bundle under it (tests/qual_v2_fixtures, sample_synthetic_bundle_*).
# Nothing at runtime imports garage.api.tests (verified by grep 2026-11-03); the root Dockerfile needs none of it.
garage/api/tests/
garage/**/tests/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
